
@startuml
title Mixed Fractions - Activity Diagram

start

:Create FractionManager;
:Read numerator and denominator;

while (Both numbers are not zero?) is (Yes)

    :Create Fraction object;

    :Calculate whole number and remainder;

    :Format fraction with BasicMixedFormatter;

    :Apply SpacedFractionDecorator;

    :Print mixed fraction;

    :Read next numerator and denominator;

endwhile (No)

stop

@enduml
